<!--
  « Modifier l’œuvre » and « Modifier l’auteur·ice » (iOS feature 0057; issue #23). French values of
  ReCIT_iOS/Localizable.xcstrings (edit_work.*, edit_author.*, edit_entity.*, entity_property.*, work_type.*,
  work_form.*, edition_choice.none), keys with '.' turned into '_' and %@ into %1$s. The entity_property_*,
  work_type_* and work_form_* names are the ones EditionProperty.labelKey and EditionPropertyChoice.labelKey give.
-->
